# Walkthrough: Branding & Header Modularization (v0.2.0-alpha)

This update establishes the new identity for the **GLOBAL INTELLIGENCE** dashboard and refactors the header into a modular Preact component.

## Key Changes

### 1. Branding Update: "GLOBAL INTELLIGENCE"
- Replaced all legacy "MONITOR" branding with "GLOBAL INTELLIGENCE".
- Updated `index.html` (title, meta tags, schema).
- Updated `src/config/variant-meta.ts` for consistent site-wide naming.
- Updated the main logo in the new `Header` component.

### 2. Dynamic Versioning (v0.2.0-alpha)
- Established `v0.2.0-alpha` as the system version.
- Modified the `Header` component to dynamically import the version from `package.json`.
- Updated `VERSION`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `package.json`, and `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`.

### 3. Modular Preact Header Component
- Created `src/components/Header.tsx` as a standalone Preact component.
- Extracted all header logic from `src/app/panel-layout.ts`, including:
    - Variant Switcher (World, Tech, Finance, Happy).
    - Social Links (X, GitHub).
    - Status Indicator & Region Selector.
    - Theme Toggle & Control Buttons.
- Integrated the component into the layout via a mount point and `render` call, ensuring a clean separation of concerns.

